Commit:     John Bieling <john@thunderbird.net>
CommitDate: Thu Feb 13 16:25:27 2025 +0100

    Bug 1895360 - Fire browser.tabs.onActivated for newly created tabs. r=freaktechnik

    We are currently not following Firefox and Chrome here.

    This patch forces a `TabSelect` event to be emitted whenever a new tab
    is created. This does send the event to all Thunderbird consumers of
    `TabSelect` as well.

    Another approach would be to only trigger the required WebExtension
    event without actually emitting an additional `TabSelect`.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D238077

